08839743_1129794973177692_3264237084820759573_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qDQ4aJgpJu0Q7kNvwFyxXeW&_nc_oc=Adqf5wzcui4LmQXst4G7Oil92SXo5EIwX7YTh3d7AosSOGrDf7EP4yt_si4gQLjkiYw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUgM5tiurI2iBTUusjT3cSvhs8kbpDq7BMh7ZNlVKc9fQ&oe=6B106A9E"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-5.png", "id": "1640074940346091", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908839685_1640074943679424_9215492237117358283_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yU9nEVWBJ7wQ7kNvwFC7s1s&_nc_oc=Ado8VF3zPQEiGBBePhTp8FTUcxxN8XlDX_kQktIM5pbV4OOyNqOXLWzo8hjWMTqia8o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQU3ZzPOa48XnkBVEERZO34uLJm3CAWhT2Yb4ejiVq9N9g&oe=6B10440A"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-4.png", "id": "1144014031789811", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908839674_1144014035123144_6545341056545174059_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4IqjkH2t3P8Q7kNvwEN-pf3&_nc_oc=AdoC3HhS9d04P_8Jb4hxGuA7ATnSGbLy4uFb0i4Xa5qUd8-ksvSekasUFAZEABBQ9NI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWhjC2lMNeBfDpCGxK8ME4D-ZBagUflPy7X3nOx7qHtPw&oe=6B103F02"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-1.png", "id": "2983781825304275", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908839737_2983781828637608_5362077282286518028_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lS9LpDom6pUQ7kNvwEznR_x&_nc_oc=AdqkykFVau_g-IEq_3fIdpnVklkS4P9zrInCh2Os4px-apWct7oBg3IkXiA9KCrylog&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQW41NEG9DxzN8qHCaZFFNz2WbTWPTlDh50c-Jpt6_prJQ&oe=6B10611F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "DUET Maths Lab 360", "keywords": ["maths", "education", "NCERT", "geometry", "STEM"], "long_description": "DUET Maths Lab 360 turns NCERT middle and secondary school maths (Classes 6 to 10) into 3D activities that students aged 10 and over can pick up, measure and build.\n\n\u2022 85+ step-by-step activities aligned with the NCERT maths books for Classes 6 to 10: show that the angles of a triangle add up to 180 degrees, build (a + b)\u00b2 with algebra tiles, verify the Baudhayana-Pythagoras theorem with squares on the sides of a right triangle, measure a flagpole's height with a clinometer, run coin-toss trials for experimental probability, and pour a cone of water into a cylinder to find its volume.\n\u2022 Real-looking 3D places with 360-degree surroundings.\n\u2022 Clear step-by-step guidance, with an explanation after every step.\n\u2022 Use the Quest controllers or hand tracking to pick things up, measure and build.\n\u2022 Narration and text in English, Hindi or Hinglish, and an Auto Play walkthrough of each activity.\n\u2022 A lab notebook saves each student's answers on the device.\n\u2022 Optional teacher-led class mode over the school's network: a teacher can open an activity for the whole class and follow each student's progress. There is no chat between students.\n\u2022 Needs the internet the first time it opens; after that it works offline.\n\nFor schools: full access comes with a DUET STEM school subscription code. Without a code, a free demo is always available: the open labs and the first activity of every class.\n\nDesigned for users aged 10 and over.", "short_description": "Hands-on school maths in real-looking 3D places, for middle and secondary students aged 10+: 85+ step-by-step activities aligned with the NCERT maths books for Classes 6 to 10, covering geometry, algebra, trigonometry, probability and mensuration. In English, Hindi and Hinglish."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ashutoshduet.github.io/duet-lms-media/maths/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DUET Power", "support_website_url": "https://ashutoshduet.github.io/duet-lms-media/sup